---
import "@fontsource-variable/inter";
import "~/styles/index.css";
import Header from "~/components/header.astro";
import Pricing from "~/components/pricing-en.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="h-full" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>Booking request preview | Lexus IS250C Car Share</title>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-full bg-default text-default">
    <Header />
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20 pt-32">
      <p class="mb-6 rounded border border-amber-400 bg-amber-100 p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">
        Prices and terms are pending confirmation. A request is not a confirmed booking.
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Request a Lexus IS250C booking</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg">Tell us when you would like to drive. Availability, driver eligibility, the final price and terms must be reviewed before payment. A booking is confirmed only after approval and payment are confirmed.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded bg-gray-800 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">How it will work</h2>
        <ol class="mt-4 list-inside list-decimal space-y-2">
          <li>Send your requested dates and driver details.</li>
          <li>We review availability and eligibility, then confirm the total and terms.</li>
          <li>If approved, pay through a secure payment provider before the stated deadline.</li>
          <li>After payment is confirmed, receive your booking confirmation. Bring your original documents for the final check at pickup.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <section aria-labelledby="etc-title" class="mt-8 rounded bg-gray-800 p-6">
        <h2 id="etc-title" class="text-xl font-semibold">ETC and tolls</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">If you would like to use ETC, tell us below. The standard toll advance is ¥10,000, adjusted according to your destinations and booking length. Plans can be undecided. We will confirm ETC availability, the advance amount, and the settlement terms before you pay.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Toll records can take time to appear and final charges may be confirmed after the car is returned. Once the actual charges are confirmed, we will provide a statement, refund any unused advance, or request payment of any shortfall. The advance is not a limit on toll charges. The refund timing and additional payment terms will be agreed before payment.</p>
      </section>
      <div class="my-12"><Pricing /></div>
      <section aria-labelledby="request-title" class="rounded bg-gray-800 p-6 sm:p-8">
        <h2 id="request-title" class="text-2xl font-bold">Booking request</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Please do not send licence or passport images, document numbers, or card details in this form.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">All dates and times are Japan time (JST, UTC+9). Fields marked required must be completed.</p>
        <p id="booking-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mt-4 rounded bg-amber-100 p-3 text-gray-900">Booking requests are currently unavailable. JavaScript and verification are required.</p>
        <form id="booking-form" class="mt-6" aria-describedby="booking-status" novalidate>
          <fieldset id="booking-fields" disabled class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <label class="space-y-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Full name (required)</span><input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="100" class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900" /></label>
            <label class="space-y-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Email address (required)</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254" class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900" /></label>
            <label class="space-y-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Pickup date and time (required)</span><input name="pickup_at" type="datetime-local" required class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900" /></label>
            <label class="space-y-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Return date and time (required)</span><input name="return_at" type="datetime-local" required class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900" /></label>
            <label class="space-y-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Licence issuing country or region (required)</span><input name="licence_country" type="text" required maxlength="100" class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900" /></label>
            <label class="space-y-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Driving document for Japan (required)</span><select name="licence_type" required class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900"><option value="">Select a document</option><option>Japanese driving licence</option><option>1949 Geneva Convention international driving permit</option><option>Eligible foreign licence and Japanese translation</option><option>Not sure</option></select></label>
            <label class="space-y-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Travel plans (optional)</span><select name="travel_plans" class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900"><option value="">Select an option</option><option>I have destinations in mind</option><option>No fixed plans yet</option></select></label>
            <label class="space-y-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Will you use toll roads? (optional)</span><select name="toll_roads" class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900"><option value="">Select an option</option><option>Yes</option><option>No</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select></label>
            <label class="space-y-2 sm:col-span-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Would you like to use ETC? (optional)</span><select name="etc_requested" class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900"><option value="">Select an option</option><option>Yes, please confirm availability and the advance amount</option><option>No</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select><span class="block text-sm">The standard advance is ¥10,000. The final amount will be adjusted to your plans and confirmed before payment.</span></label>
            <label class="space-y-2 sm:col-span-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Expected destinations or route (optional)</span><textarea name="destinations" rows="3" maxlength="500" placeholder="For example: Hakone and Lake Kawaguchi. Leave blank if your plans are undecided." class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900"></textarea></label>
            <label class="space-y-2 sm:col-span-2"><span class="block font-semibold">Additional information (optional)</span><textarea name="notes" rows="4" maxlength="1000" class="w-full rounded border border-gray-400 bg-white p-3 text-gray-900"></textarea></label>
            <div id="booking-verification" class="sm:col-span-2"></div>
            <div class="sm:col-span-2"><p class="mb-4 text-sm">Read the <a class="font-semibold underline" href="/en/terms/">draft rental and ETC terms</a>. Terms are not final.</p><button id="booking-submit" type="submit" class="rounded bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white disabled:bg-gray-500">Send booking request</button></div>
          </fieldset>
        </form>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script>import "../../scripts/booking";</script>
  </body>
</html>
